docs {
  ## Method, Endpoint, and Auth

  `GET /api/v1/groups/:groupID` — Active group member or site admin; Bearer access token required.

  ## Description

  Returns group details, active members with their roles, and invitation links.

  ## Request

  ### Path Parameters

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `groupID` | `integer` | Yes | Positive group ID. |

  ### Headers

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `Authorization` | `string` | Yes | `Bearer <access-token>` |

  ## Response

  **`200 OK`**
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "id": 42,
      "title": "Weekend trip",
      "created_by_user_id": 7,
      "status": "ACTIVE",
      "is_premium": false,
      "created_at": "2026-11-04T10:00:00Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-11-04T10:00:00Z",
      "member_count": 2,
      "members": [
        {"member_id": 11, "user_id": 7, "name": "Owner", "role": "OWNER", "joined_at": "2026-11-04T10:00:00Z"},
        {"member_id": 12, "user_id": 8, "name": "Member", "role": "MEMBER", "joined_at": "2026-11-04T10:10:00Z"}
      ],
      "invites": []
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Errors

  - `400 GROUP_INVALID_ID` — `groupID` is not a positive integer.
  - `401 MISSING_TOKEN` — Access token is missing or invalid.
  - `403 GROUP_FORBIDDEN` — Requester is neither an active member nor an admin.
  - `404 GROUP_NOT_FOUND` — Group does not exist or was deleted.
  - `500 INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR` — Group details could not be retrieved.
}
